# auth0/ (Terraform, specs/012 research R17): local state and plans can hold tenant data. The provider lock file
# (.terraform.lock.hcl) and each environment's <environment>.tfvars are committed: the pipeline reads them, and they
# hold no secret (T-IAC-02).
